  "notes": "FORMATION:\n{調|ちょう} (arrange/prepare) + {理|り} (manage/reason)\n\nCOLLOCATIONS:\n・{調理|ちょうり}する - to cook, to prepare\n・{調理|ちょうり}{器具|きぐ} - cooking utensils\n・{調理|ちょうり}{方法|ほうほう} - cooking method\n・{調理|ちょうり}{時間|じかん} - cooking time\n・{調理|ちょうり}{済|ず}み - pre-cooked\n・{調理|ちょうり}{師|し} - chef (licensed)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{料理|りょうり} - cooking, dish, cuisine (broader; includes the result)\n・{調理|ちょうり} focuses on the process/technique; {料理|りょうり} can mean both the act and the finished dish\n\nREGISTER:\nSlightly formal/technical. Common in recipes, professional contexts, and product labels.",
